ck, every time.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"hero-buttons\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-primary\">EXPLORE THE RANGE</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-link\">Our Story →</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-right\">\n      <div class=\"img-frame\">\n        <img class=\"rusk-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0743/8522/8003/files/Classic_Rusk.png?v=1777442862\" alt=\"Classic Rusk\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>",
